setrow('SX','not_verified','Sint Maarten LVV regulates imports of plants and plant produce; its published plant form does not settle manufactured tea or a personal exemption.','No affirmative postal processed-tea rule found.','Government of Sint Maarten LVV',['https://www.sintmaartengov.org/Ministries/Departments/Pages/Agriculture-Livestock-and-Fisheries.aspx','https://www.newgmc.com/index.php?download=466%3Aproduce-and-plant-produce-import-form&id=35%3Asops-a-ssops&option=com_phocadownload&view=category'],'Confirm whether sencha is regulated and whether certificates or permits apply to personal parcels.')
